criteria.minimum:
Public Liability with a minimum indemnity limit of 5M GBP for each and every claim including abuse and molestation cover but with no inner limit on abuse;
Professional Indemnity with a minimum indemnity limit of 2M GBP for each and every claim;
Employers Liability with a minimum indemnity limit of 5M GBP for each and every claim;
Data Protection/Cyber Risk with a minimum indemnity limit of 1M GBP.

criteria.description:
Full financial statements (not filing accounts) for the last 3 financial years available; if no accounts are available (eg new company) then a bank reference is required.  Where accounts are not in English, the Tenderer must provide certified extracts in the English language;
A current bank reference which supports that the company could currently support an annual contract value of at least 150,000 GBP per annum; or
A credit rating check report to support a minimum annual value of 150,000 GBP; or
An average minimum general turnover of 100,000 GBP for the last 3 financial years available; or
A minimum general turnover of 100,000 GBP for the last financial year available; or
A minimum general turnover of 100,000 GBP for the current financial year by supporting verifiable evidence such as an extract from the company's finance and accounting software;
Evidence of current Employers and Public Liability Insurances to a minimum of 10,000,000 GBP and 5,000,000 GBP respectively;
Evidence of Professional Indemnity Insurance with a minimum limit of indemnity of 2,000,000 GBP.
